HEADS AAAAB

START ***** INIT1 ***** SSSSR

// First, replace all of the = with ~ to fill in the water
INIT1 ####* INIT1 ####* RRRRS
INIT1 ====* INIT1 ~~~~* RRRRS
INIT1 ____* INIT2 ***** LLLLS
INIT2 !!!!* INIT2 ***** LLLLS
INIT2 ____* INIT3 ***** RRRRS
INIT3 ***** FIRST ***** LSRDU

// FIRST: Make the first pass on a row
FIRST *#*** FIRST ***#* RRRRS
FIRST #~*** FIRST ***#* RRRRS
FIRST ~~~** FIRST ***~D RRRRS
FIRST ~~#** FIRST ***#* RRRRS
FIRST #_*** RETN0 ***** LLLLS

// RETN: Return the the left not deleting rocks
RETN0 *!*** RETN0 ***** LLLLS
RETN0 *_*** RETN1 ***** RRRRS
RETN1 ***** PASS0 ***** DDDDS

// RETY: Return the the left deleting rocks
RETY0 *#*** RETY0 *_*** LLLLS
RETY0 *~*** RETY0 *~*** LLLLS
RETY0 *_*** RETY1 ***** RRRRS
RETY1 ***** PASS0 ***** DDDDS

// Next, make a pass propagating the rocks and water down
PASS0 ****D PASS1 ****_ SSSSS  // Check if we should process another row
PASS0 ****_ CLEAN ***** SSSSS
PASS1 *#*** PASS1 ***#* RRRRS
PASS1 #~*** PASS1 ***#* RRRRS
PASS1 ~~~** PASS1 ***~D RRRRS
PASS1 ~~#** PASS1 ***#* RRRRS
PASS1 #_*** PASS2 ***** LLLLS
PASS2 ***** RETY0 ***** SSSSS

// CLEAN: Move across the row cleaning up rocks
CLEAN *#*** CLEAN *_*** RRRRS
CLEAN *~*** CLEAN ***** RRRRS
CLEAN *_*** STOP  ***** SSSSS
